# _versions/v4/

Frozen snapshot of every file in this module at the moment version v4 was
declared complete. The LXD copies working files here BEFORE starting the
next revision, so diff-vN-to-vN+1.md can be regenerated even if intermediate
state was lost.

Snapshot timing (8-step workflow):
  v1 — after Step 1 (LXD produces v1)
  v2 — after Step 3 (LXD fixes Red Team findings)
  v3 — after Step 6 (LXD applies the human's Editor decisions)
  v4 — after Step 8 (LXD applies the human's final-panel decisions, if any)
